Hello,

We have received and processed the reconciliation requested pursuant to section 2.3 of the Agreement.  Based on the business’s deposits over the last two months, your adjusted remittance amount will be:

{!Case.Adjusted_Remittance__c}


The adjusted remit will be effective immediately and will remain as the remittance due until the Purchased Amount is paid in full or until any subsequent reconciliations.


Please don’t hesitate to contact us with any questions.




Thank you,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

